# Search: skew

*2 matches in 1 session, `/home/dev/app`*

## 1. Fix token refresh

`aaaa1111` · 2026-03-01 09:00 – 2026-03-02 17:45 · turns 0–3 · 2 matches in turn 1

**#1 🤖 Claude · 2026-03-01 09:01** · `claudegrep read aaaa1111 --from 1.0`

> The clock skew check compared local time with UTC.
>
> So tokens looked expired early.

**#1 🤖 Claude · 2026-03-01 09:01** · `claudegrep read aaaa1111 --from 1.1`

> ## Fix
>
> - convert both sides to UTC
> - allow 30 s of skew

